│ ethnicity‐specific incidence rates do not differ in this population.Wiley Online Library"}, {"study_index": 14,      │
│ "title": "Comparison of carbamazepine, phenobarbital, phenytoin and primidone in focal and secondary generalized     │
│ tonic‐clonic seizures", "abstract": "We conducted a 10-center, double-blind trial to compare the efficacy and        │
