│ observed changes were statistically significant.europepmc.org"}, {"study_index": 17, "title": "Incidence of          │
│ unprovoked seizures and epilepsy in Iceland and assessment of the epilepsy syndrome classification: a prospective    │
│ study", "abstract": "BackgroundNo population-based incidence studies of epilepsy have studied syndrome               │
