│ {"study_index": 3, "title": "Multiple treatment comparisons in epilepsy monotherapy trials", "abstract": "The choice │
│ of antiepileptic drug for an individual should be based upon the highest quality evidence regarding potential        │
│ benefits and harms of the available treatments. Systematic reviews and meta-analysis of randomised controlled trials │
│ should be a major source of evidence supporting this decision making process. We summarise all available individual  │
